<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="1TI" style="id">- Gamo Full Bible final version</book>
  <para style="h">1Ximtoosas</para>
  <para style="toc1">Phawuloosi Ximtoosas Xaafida Koyro Kiita</para>
  <para style="toc2">1Ximtoosas</para>
  <para style="toc3">1Xim</para>
  <para style="mt2">Phawuloosi</para>
  <para style="mt1">Ximtoosas</para>
  <para style="mt2">Xaafida Koyro Kiita</para>
  <para style="imt1">Giddo Qofa</para>
  <para style="ip">Ximtoosa geetettiza issi naateththa nay izaskka yeleta derey qeeri Iisiya gidishin, iza aayeya Ayhuda as; aaway qasse Girike as. Izi Mishiraachcho qaalaa ooson Phawuloosara issife ooththiza mata lagge. (Hawa 16:1-3) Phawuloosi Ximtoosas koyro xaafida kiitazi heedzdzu ayfe yo7ota oykkides.</para>
  <para style="ip">He kiitazan ayfe qofay sinththatidi Woosa Keeththa garsan dendida wordo timirtefe asay naagettana malassa. Ha wordo timirtezi baggay Ayhudatappe baggay qasse Ayzaabeta qofaa oykkidaaz gidishin, «Hayssi ayfen beettiza alamezi nagaran moorettida gishshas asas paxeteththi beettanay hara dumma dumma xuura erateththaninne issi issi qumata montta agon, ekkonttanne gelontta agonkko» giza qofaa. Hessafekka bollara iza kiitazi Woosa Keeththa ayso gishshassinne Xoos goyno gishshas tamaarsiza wogay hessaththoka Woosa Keeththa cimatinne istta maaddizaytas de7anaas bessizay aazakko yootees. Wurseththan Ximtoosi Yesus Kirstoosas lo7o oosanchcha waani gidanaas bessizaakko izas dumma dumma ammanizayta bolla diza alaafeteththaa gishshas Phawuloosi izas immida zore beyoos.</para>
  <para style="iot">Ha Maxaafay Oykkida Kumeththa Qofa</para>
  <para style="io1">Geloso <char style="ior"><ref loc="1TI 1:1-2">1:1-2</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Woosa keeththa gishshassinne Woosa Keeththa garsan ooththizayta gishshas <char style="ior"><ref loc="1TI 1:3-3:16">1:3—3:16</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Ximtoosas iza ooso gishshas imettida timirte <char style="ior"><ref loc="1TI 4:1-6:21">4:1—6:21</ref> </char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1TI 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TI 1:1" />Nuna ashshida Xoossaan, nuus hidota gidida Yesus Kirstoosa azazon Hawaare gidida Phawuloosappe <verse eid="1TI 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TI 1:2" />Ammanon taas tumu naa gidida Ximtoosas Xoossaa nu Aawappe nu Godaa Yesus Kirstoosappe kiyateththi, maaroteththinne saroy nees gido.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 16:1">Hawa 16:1</ref></char></note><verse eid="1TI 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Wordo Astamaaretappe Naagettana Mala Imettida Azazo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TI 1:3" />Tani Maqidooniya bashe nena hadara gida mala hayssafe sinththan issi issi asati wordo timirte tamaarsontta mala ne azazanaas Efesoonen daashsha. <verse eid="1TI 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TI 1:4" />Qasseka asay yootiin wurontta beni wode haysi7en ba wode wursontta mala azaza; heyta mala yo7oy palama denththeththees attiin ammanon oosettiza Xoossa oosos aykkoka go7enna. <verse eid="1TI 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TI 1:5" />Ha azazozas waanna ayfe yo7oy gidikko geeshsha wozinappe lo7o qofara hessaththoka tumu ammanoppe beettiza siiqo. <verse eid="1TI 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TI 1:6" />Issi issi asay haytappe pooqqi eqqidi go7ay baynda yo7otakko simmides. <verse eid="1TI 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TI 1:7" />Wogaa tamaarsizayta gidana mala koyeettes; gidikkoka istti ba yootizayssa woykko keehi mootettiza yo7oza lo7eththi erettenna.<verse eid="1TI 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TI 1:8" />Gido attiin asi maaran go7ettizaakko wogay lo7o gididayssa nu eroos. <verse eid="1TI 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TI 1:9" />Qasseka wogay imettiday xillo asas gidontta wogaa yedhdhi aadhdhizaytas, azazettonttaytas, Xoossas babbonttaytas, nagaranchchatas, geeshshateththi bayndaytas, Xoos leqqizaytas, ba aayonne ba aawaa wodhizaytassinne shemppo wodhizaytas gididayssa nu eroos. <verse eid="1TI 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TI 1:10" />Hessaththoka laymatizaytas, addera aqiza addetas, as bayzizaytassinne shammizaytas, wordanchchatas, asas wordora caaqqizaytas, lo7o timirtera eqettiza ubbatassa. <verse eid="1TI 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TI 1:11" />He lo7o timirtey anjjettida Xoossi taas hadara immida bonchcho mishiraachcho qaalara gaaggizayssa.<verse eid="1TI 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Phawuloosas Imettida Xoossa Imota</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TI 1:12" />Tana ba oosos shuumidinne ammanettizaade histti ekkidinne taas minoteth immida nu Godaa Yesus Kirstoosa ta galatays. <verse eid="1TI 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TI 1:13" />Hayssafe kase ta ay mala as cayizaadenne goodeththizaade, qasse makkalla as gidikkoka hessa ta eronttanne ammanontta dashe ooththida gishshas Xoossi tana maarides.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 8:3">Hawa 8:3</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 9:4-5">9:4-5</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1TI 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TI 1:14" />Yesus Kirstoosappe gidida ammanoranne siiqora nu Godaa kiyateththi taas keehi darides.<verse eid="1TI 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TI 1:15" />Yesus Kirstoosi nagaranchchata ashshanaas duge hayssa ha alame yides giza qaalay tumanne asi wurikka ekkanaas bessizayssa. Nagaranchchatappeka aadhdhiza nagaranchchay tana. <verse eid="1TI 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TI 1:16" />Gido attiin ta maarettidaykka Yesus Kirstoosi zaway baynda ba dandayaa, ubbaafe aadhdhida nagaranchcha gidida ta bolla bessiday izan ammananaytassinne mernaa de7o demmanaytas leemiso gidana malassa. <verse eid="1TI 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TI 1:17" />Hessa gishshas mernaas hayqqi erontta, ayfen beetti erontta barkka xalla Xoos gidida kawos mernaappe mernaa gakkanaas izas bonchchoynne galatay gido. Amiin.<verse eid="1TI 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TI 1:18" />Ta naa Ximtoosaa! Ne gishshas kasetidi yootettida mala hayssa azazoza ta nees immadis; hessika ne he qaalaa kaallashe lo7o baaxe baaxetanaassa. <verse eid="1TI 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1TI 1:19" />Ammanoynne lo7o qofay nees de7o; issi issi asati ba lo7o qofaa yedhdhi aadhdhidi abba bolla metoy iza bolla gakkiin waayettiza markabe mala ba ammano dhayssida. <verse eid="1TI 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1TI 1:20" />Istta giddon Xoossa cash aggidi taamarana mala tani Xala7es aaththa immidayti Hemenewoosinne Iskindiroosi deettes.<verse eid="1TI 1:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TI 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1TI 2" />
  <para style="s1">Xoossas Goyno Gishshas Imettida Woga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TI 2:1" />Hessa gishshas ubbaafe koyro hara asas shoobeththa woosa, gaannateththa woosanne galata woosa asa ubbaas kawotassinne dere ayssizaytas ubbaas woossana mala ta nena qofsays. <verse eid="1TI 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TI 2:2" />Hessika Tumu Ayana duussaninne geeshshateth ubbaan nuni saroteththaninne wogan daana malassa. <verse eid="1TI 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TI 2:3" />Hayssi nuna ashshiza Xoossaa achchan lo7onne ufayssizaaza. <verse eid="1TI 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TI 2:4" />Izi asi wuri attana malanne tumaa erana mala koyees. <verse eid="1TI 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TI 2:5" />Issi Xoossi xalla dees; qasseka Xoossassinne asas giddon issi giigsiza gaannay dees; izikka as gidida Yesus Kirstoosa. <verse eid="1TI 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TI 2:6" />Izi bana asa ubbaas aaththi immides; hessika heerakka wodey aadhdhontta izas markkattides. <verse eid="1TI 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TI 2:7" />Tanikka hayssas mishiraachcho qaala yootanaas kiitettidaade; qasseka deretas tumu ammano astamaare gidada shuumettadis; hessaka ta wordotontta tumu yootanaassa.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2TI 1:11">2Xim 1:11</ref></char></note><verse eid="1TI 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TI 2:8" />Hessa gishshas attuma asay ubbason hanqoy bayndanne palamay baynda ba geeshsha kusheta pude dhoqqu histtidi woossana mala ta koyays. <verse eid="1TI 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TI 2:9" />Hessaththoka maccassati bonchchora bana shiishshi ekkidi bessiza may7o may7etto attiin ba hu7e daddi ekkidi woykko al7o may7o, worqqanne inqqu aaththidi walqqi walqqi gooppetto.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1PE 3:3">1Phex 3:3</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1TI 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TI 2:10" />Gido attiin Xoos woossoos giza maccassati isttas ooththana bessiza lo7o ooson lo7etto.<verse eid="1TI 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TI 2:11" />Maccassi co7u gaada kumeththara azazeteth tamaaru. <verse eid="1TI 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TI 2:12" />Maccassi co7u gaanaappe attiin iza tamaarsana mala woykko adde bolla godatana mala ta koykke. <verse eid="1TI 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TI 2:13" />Gaasoykka koyro Addaamey medhettides; kaallada Hewaana medhettadus.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 2:7">Medhe 2:7</ref>,<ref loc="GEN 2:21-22">21-22</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1TI 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TI 2:14" />Qasseka koyro balettiday Addaame gidenna; balettada Xoossa wogaappe aadhdhiday maccassayo.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 3:1-6">Medhe 3:1-6</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1TI 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TI 2:15" />Gidikkoka maccassi ammanoninne siiqon geeshshateththan barkka bana haaron minniko naa yelon attana.<verse eid="1TI 2:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TI 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1TI 3" />
  <para style="s1">Woosa Keeth Kaaleththizayta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TI 3:1" />«Oonikka Woosa Keeththa cima gidana koykko lo7o ooso amottees» giza qaalay tuma. <verse eid="1TI 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TI 3:2" />Hessa gidikko Woosa Keeththe kaaleththizaadey borey bayndaade, issi machcha diza adde, ginara dizaade, bana haarizaade, wogara aqizaade, imath mokkizaade, tamaarsanaas dandayzaade, <verse eid="1TI 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TI 3:3" />maththottonttaade, oosh ooyettonttaade, qasse maarage as, asara palamettonttaade, miish gooddonttaade gidanaas bessees. <verse eid="1TI 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TI 3:4" />Ba nayta azazettizaytanne as bonchchizayta histti dichchidi ba keeththa asaa wogara ayssizaade gidanaas bessees. <verse eid="1TI 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TI 3:5" />Issaadey ba keeththa asaa wogara ayso erontta aggiko Xoossa Woosa Keeththe wostti naagana dandayzee? <verse eid="1TI 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TI 3:6" />Otoreteththan puuridi Xala7ey kundida pirdan izi kundontta mala oorath ammanizaade gidoppo. <verse eid="1TI 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TI 3:7" />Qasseka iza sunththan boretontta malanne Xala7e narxan izi gelontta mala ammanontta asaa achchan lo7o markkateththi daanaas koshshees.<verse eid="1TI 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TI 3:8" />Daaqonetikka hessaththo bonchchettidaytanne ba gida qaalaa laammi laammi yeggonttayta, daro woyne ushshas amottonttayta, ogey baynda go7a gooddonttayta gidanaas bessees. <verse eid="1TI 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TI 3:9" />Ammano xuura, lo7o qofara naaganaas bessees. <verse eid="1TI 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TI 3:10" />Haytantika koyrotti paacettetto; issi iitay istta bolla beettontta aggiko hessafe guye daaqoneteththan ooththetto. <verse eid="1TI 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TI 3:11" />Macca daaqonetikka bonchchettidayta, zigironttayta, qasse wogara dizayta, hano ubbaan ammanettidayta gidanaas bessees. <verse eid="1TI 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TI 3:12" />Daaqoneti issi machchi azina gidanaas bessees; qasseka ba naytanne ba keeththa asaa wogara ayssizayta gidanaas bessees. <verse eid="1TI 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TI 3:13" />Wogara ooththidayti baas gita bonchchonne Yesus Kirstoosan isttas diza ammanon daro xalateth demmana.<verse eid="1TI 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TI 3:14" />Ta neekko elle baana koykkoka hayta azazota nees xaafays. <verse eid="1TI 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TI 3:15" />Ta hanno nees xaafizay ta gam7izaa gidikkoka asay Xoossa Keeththan waani daanaakko ne erana mala gaadakko! Keeththay de7o Xoossaa Woosa Keeththa; hessika tumu tuussinne xapho. <verse eid="1TI 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TI 3:16" />Tumu Ayana duussa xuuray sidhey baynda gita; izikka,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1TI 3:16">«Ase gidides;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1TI 3:16">iza Xilloteththi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1TI 3:16">Xillo Ayanan qonccides;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1TI 3:16">kiitanchchatas beettides;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1TI 3:16">dere ubbaas sabbakettides;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1TI 3:16">alamen dizaytan ammanettides;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1TI 3:16">bonchchora pude dendi bides» gizayssa.<verse eid="1TI 3:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TI 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1TI 4" />
  <para style="s1">Wordo Tamaarsizayta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TI 4:1" />Wode wurseththa bolla issi issi asay ammano aggidi baleththiza ayanatanne iita ayana timirte kaallanayssa Xillo Ayanay qonccera yootees. <verse eid="1TI 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TI 4:2" />Hessa mala timirtey istta qofay bonqo biratan xuugettida mala geellateththan doccida qoodheppe qommon haniza wordanchcha asatappe yaana. <verse eid="1TI 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TI 4:3" />He asati asay ekkontta malanne gelontta mala diggana; ammanizaytinne tumaa shaakki eriza asay Xoossi medhdhida kath galatarakka ekkizayti montta mala diggananne azazana. <verse eid="1TI 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TI 4:4" />Xoossi medhdhiday wurikka lo7o; asi galatara ekkiko wora wodhdhizay issinakka deenna. <verse eid="1TI 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TI 4:5" />Wurikka Xoossa qaalaninne woosan geeyana.<verse eid="1TI 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kirstoosas Lo7o Ooththiza Oosanchcha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TI 4:6" />Hayssa ha azazoza ammaniza asaa ne qofsikko, ammano qaalaninne ne ekkida lo7o timirtezan minnada Yesus Kirstoosas lo7o oosanchcha gidandasa. <verse eid="1TI 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TI 4:7" />Xoos bonchchisontta go7ay baynda haysi7eppenne cima maccassata haysi7eppe haakkada tuma ayana oosos ne asateth giigsa.<verse eid="1TI 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TI 4:8" />Asateththaa asho ogen dosisoy guuththa wodes go7ees shin Tumu Ayana duussas bana tamaarsoy gidikko hayssa ha alamezassinne buro yaana duussaas hidotay diza gishshas ubbaas go7ees. <verse eid="1TI 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TI 4:9" />Hayssi ha qaalay ammanettidayssanne ubbay ekkanaas bessiza qaala. <verse eid="1TI 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TI 4:10" />Nu hessas giidi dafettoossinne<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:10 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Dafettoos: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Dafettoos gizayssa issi issi birsheththa maxaafati, «Baaxetoos» gishin issi issineti, «Cayettoos» giidi birshida.</char></note> daaburoos; hessika asa ubbaas harappeka ammanizaytas ashshiza de7o Xoossaan nu hidota ooththiza gishshassa.<verse eid="1TI 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TI 4:11" />Hayta yo7ota azazanne tamaarsa. <verse eid="1TI 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TI 4:12" />Ne yelagateththaa oonikka leqqofo; gido attiin neni haasayan, duussan, siiqon, ammanoninne geeshshateththan ammanizaytas lo7o leemiso gida. <verse eid="1TI 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TI 4:13" />Ta hee baana gakkanaas qaalaa nababanaas, zoranaassinne tamaarsanaas minna. <verse eid="1TI 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TI 4:14" />Cimati ne bolla ba kushe woththi woossishin, nees imettida tinbite imoteththaa leppi histta aggofa. <verse eid="1TI 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TI 4:15" />Asi wuri ne dichchaa beyana mala ha yo7ota lo7eththa minththada dandayan pola. <verse eid="1TI 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TI 4:16" />Ne duussaa gishshassinne ne tamaarsiza timirtezas naagetta; haytan minna; ne hessa ooththiko nenanne ne gizayssa siyizayta ashshana.<verse eid="1TI 4:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TI 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1TI 5" />
  <para style="s1">Am7eta, Cimatanne Aylleta Gishshas Imettida Zore</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TI 5:1" />Cima asaa ne Aawaa mala bonchchora zora attiin dom7ofa; naateththa attuma nayta ne ishata mala xeella. <verse eid="1TI 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TI 5:2" />Hessaththoka cima maccassata ne aayi mala, naateththa maccassata qasse ne michcheta mala suure wozinappe xeella.<verse eid="1TI 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TI 5:3" />Addafe metotettida am7eta lo7eththa naaga. <verse eid="1TI 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TI 5:4" />Issi am7eys nay woykko naa nay dizaa gidikko he nayti baso asata maaddanaassinne bana yelidaytas kase istti ooththidayssa kushe zaaron harappe kasetidi ba ammano ooson bessanaassinne tamaaranaas bessees; hessika Xoos ufayssizayssa.<verse eid="1TI 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TI 5:5" />Qasse tumappe maadoy baynda barkka diza am7eya Xoos xalla xeellawus; woosassinne Xoossafe maado demmanaas gallassinne qamma minettawus. <verse eid="1TI 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TI 5:6" />Ha biittaa lo7o duus xalla koyza am7eya gidikko iza paxa dashe hayqqidaaro. <verse eid="1TI 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TI 5:7" />Oona bollaka wosoy dontta mala hayssa azazoza asas aaththa. <verse eid="1TI 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TI 5:8" />Issi asi ba dabbota harappeka baso asaa maaddonttayssa gidikko izi ammano kaddidaadenne ammanontta asappeka aadhdhi iita asa.<verse eid="1TI 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TI 5:9" />Izis layththay usuppun tammu layththafe garsan diza am7ey sunth am7eta mazgaban xaafoppa; qasseka iza kase issaade xalla gelidaaro gidanaas bessees. <verse eid="1TI 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TI 5:10" />Nayta dichoninne imaththa mokon, ammanizayta toho meechchan, metotidayta maadoninne lo7o ooso ubbaan bana aaththa immada lo7o oosonkka keeha erettidaaro gidanaas bessees.<verse eid="1TI 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TI 5:11" />Naateththa am7eta gidikko hessa mala mazgaban xaafoppa; gaasoykka isttas diza azinara daana amoy istti Kirstoosas ooththana gi gelida qaalaappe bollara aadhdhiza wode adde gelana koyeettes. <verse eid="1TI 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TI 5:12" />Istti kase caaqqida qaalaa miza gishshas he yo7ozan ba bolla pirda eheettes. <verse eid="1TI 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TI 5:13" />Hessafekka ooso ooththanaappe yuuyi yuuyi asa keeththe gelana doseettes; ooso ixo xalla gidontta haasayanaas bessonttayssa haasayshe zigirzaytanne koshshontta asa yo7o giddo coo woxxi gelizayta gideettes. <verse eid="1TI 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TI 5:14" />Hessa gishshas azinati hayqqida naateththa maccassati adde gelana mala, nayta yelana malanne baso as ayssana mala, morkkeyka istta bolla woththiza miishshe demmontta mala ta zorays. <verse eid="1TI 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TI 5:15" />Addaka hayssafe kase issi issi asati Xala7e kaallana guye sher7i gida. <verse eid="1TI 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TI 5:16" />Ammaniza maccassi oonikka baso asaa giddon am7eti dizaa gidikko Woosa Keeththi tumu am7eta xalla maaddana mala izakka ba baggara ba am7eta maaddu attiin Woosa Keeththas tooho gidana mala aggufu.<verse eid="1TI 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TI 5:17" />Woosa keeththaa lo7eththi ayssizayti harappeka sabbakoninne tamaarson minniza cimati gidikko dakko maado maadettanaas bessees. <verse eid="1TI 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TI 5:18" />Maxaafan, «Kath bukkiza boora doona qachchofa.» qasseka, «Ooso ooththizaadey damoza ekkana bessees» gees.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 25:4">Zaare 25:4</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 10:10">Mato 10:10</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:7">Luqa 10:7</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1TI 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1TI 5:19" />Nam7u markkay woykko heedzdzu markkay markkattontta dishin cima bolla shiiqiza mooto ekkofa.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 17:5-7">Zaare 17:5-7</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 19:15">19:15</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1TI 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1TI 5:20" />Harati be7idi naagettana mala nagara ooththizayta asa ubbaa sinththan hanqa.<verse eid="1TI 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1TI 5:21" />Xoossaninne Yesus Kirstoosan doorettida kiitanchchata sinththan hayta azazota oonakka maaddontta ne naagana malanne issi miishshika ta goorippe ziqqi dhoqqu histtontta mala ta nena hadara gays. <verse eid="1TI 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1TI 5:22" />Xoossa oosos dooranaas, oona bollaka ne kushe woththa woossanaas eesotoppa; qasse haratara nagara ooththanaas zuppetoppa; nagarappe nena xilloteththan naaga.<verse eid="1TI 5:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1TI 5:23" />Nena qanththan sakkizayssassinne ubba wode sakkiza sakoza gishshas woyne cajjefe guuth gujjada uya attiin hayssafe guye haaththe xalla uyoppa.<verse eid="1TI 5:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1TI 5:24" />Issi issi asaa nagaray pirday yaanaappe kasetidi qonccees; baggayta nagaray gidikko pirdafe guye qonccees. <verse eid="1TI 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1TI 5:25" />Lo7o oosoykka hessa mala qoncce; qoncconttay diikkoka qotetti attenna.<verse eid="1TI 5:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TI 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="1TI 6" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TI 6:1" />Xoossa sunththinne iza timirtey cayettontta mala aylleteththa qambara giddon dizayti wuri ba godaas kumeththa bonchchoy bessizayssa eretto. <verse eid="1TI 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TI 6:2" />Ammaniza godati diza ammaniza ashkarati godati isttas ishata gidida gishshas godatas bessiza bonchcho immetto; harappeka istta ooson maadettiza ammaniza godati isttas dosettidayta gidida gishshas nekka haytantta mala yo7ota tamaarsanaassinne zoranaas bessees.<verse eid="1TI 6:2" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Wordo Timirtenne Tumu Dureteth</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TI 6:3" />Oonikka wordo timirte tamaarsiko Godaa Yesus Kirstoosa lo7o qaalanne Ayana tumateththaa minththiza timirtera gaaggonttayssa gidikko, <verse eid="1TI 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TI 6:4" />hessaadey otoreteththan kumidessinne aykkoka yuushshi qoppenna; issi issi qaalata gishshas palamettanaassinne ooyetanaas iita amoy izan dees; heytikka qanaateteth, oosh, cash, iita sidhe kaaleththeettes. <verse eid="1TI 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TI 6:5" />Tumay isttafe eketti gidiin Ayana ooson wodhe demmana misatiza asatanne qofa pace asata giddon gooshettidi duuxxontta oosh eheettes.<verse eid="1TI 6:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TI 6:6" />Gido attiin Tumu Ayana as gideththi nuus dizayssan woppu giidi duussara gita wodhe. <verse eid="1TI 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TI 6:7" />Gaasoykka nu hayssa ha alameza yishe aykkoka ekki yibeekko; bishekka qasse aykkoka ekki bookko. <verse eid="1TI 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TI 6:8" />Gido attiin nuus maanayssinne nu may7anayssi diikko gidana. <verse eid="1TI 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TI 6:9" />Dure gidanaas koyzayti gidikko gede paaceninne narxan gelidi oykettizayssa mala daro hadaninne iita amon un7etteettes. <verse eid="1TI 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TI 6:10" />Gaasoykka miishsha siiqoy iitateth ubbaas xapho; issi issi asati dure gidana giidi amottida amoppe dendidayssan ammano ogeppe balettidi haraso bidanne barkka bana daro meto giddo gelththida.<verse eid="1TI 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Phawuloosi Ximtoosas Immida Hadara Qaala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TI 6:11" />Nenoo Xoossa asoo! Ne hessa ubbaafe baqata; xilloteth, Tumu Ayanan duus, ammano, siiqo, dandayanne ashketeth kaalla. <verse eid="1TI 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TI 6:12" />Ammano baaxe lo7eththa baaxeta; daro markkatta sinththan lo7o ammaneteththan ne markkattidayssanne ne izas xeygettida mernaa de7oza lo7eththa oykka. <verse eid="1TI 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TI 6:13" />Ubbaasikka de7o immiza Xoossaa achchan hessaththoka Phanxoosa Philaxoosa sinththan tumaa markkattida Yesus Kirstoosa sinththan ta nena hadara gizay,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 18:37">Yoha 18:37</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1TI 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TI 6:14" />Godaa Yesus Kirstoosi qonccana gakkanaas nees imettida oosoza wosoy baynda ne polana mala bessees. <verse eid="1TI 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TI 6:15" />He qoncceththi anjjettidayssi barkka ubbaa haarizayssinne kawota kawoy, godatas Goday izi ba woden bessana. <verse eid="1TI 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TI 6:16" />Izi xalla hayqqonttayssa; oonikka shiiqanaas dandayontta poo7o giddon dees; iza be7ida asi oonikka baa; beyana dandayzaadeyka deenna; izas wolqqaynne bonchchoy mernaappe mernaas gido. Amiin.<verse eid="1TI 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TI 6:17" />Hayssa ha alamezan duretidayti otorettontta mala azaza; nu ufayettana mala wursika darssi tirfisidi nuus immiza Xoossaan attiin ammanththontta miishshaan ammanettontta mala asaas yoota. <verse eid="1TI 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TI 6:18" />Lo7o ooththana malanne lo7o ooson dureta gidana mala, kiyatanne shaakki immanaas dosizayta gidana mala asaa azaza. <verse eid="1TI 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1TI 6:19" />Hessaththoka tumu gidida de7o demmana mala buroppe yaana wodes asay mino xapho gidiza haaro baas shiishshana.<verse eid="1TI 6:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1TI 6:20" />Ximtoosaa! Ne hadara ekkidayssa wursa naaga; Xoossaa bonchchisontta hada doona lom7ulom7afenne wordo erateth geetettiza asi baappe medhdhi kessida timirtefe haakka. <verse eid="1TI 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1TI 6:21" />Nuus hessa mala erateththi dees giza issi issi asati hessaththo ooson ammano ogeppe balettida; Xoossa kiyateththi inttenara gido.<verse eid="1TI 6:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TI 6" />
</usx>